[I] Command line parser for C++11

[T] CLI11 is a command line parser for C++11 and beyond that provides a rich
[T] feature set with a simple and intuitive interface.

[U] https://cliutils.github.io/CLI11/book/

[A] University of Cincinnati
[A] Henry Schreiner
